Third-Party Code Attribution
=============================

The source files in this directory contain code derived from the RustDesk
project (https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk). They implement parts of the
RustDesk peer/rendezvous protocol (the "hbbs / hbbr" wire protocol, NaCl
cryptographic handshake and related helpers), as also indicated by comments
such as "RustDesk-compatible" and "RustDesk wire format" within the files.

