2026-10-26 XSCC managed-host changes:
  Added the XSCC KX1 split-key transport prelude and instance/epoch-bound
  session proofs in managed.rs, updated peer protobuf fields, connected
  management lease revocation to native connection shutdown, and made
  frame decoding cancellation-safe. Native video sessions reserve the shared
  encoder only while active. Original RustDesk and One-KVM attribution and
  AGPL-3.0-only licensing remain applicable. Reused XSCC protocol/client
  sources and their exact origin records are in crates/management.
